<title>USA: Galaxy Foods Co cuts FY March 31 loss.</title>
<headline>Galaxy Foods Co cuts FY March 31 loss.</headline>
<dateline>ORLANDO, Fla. 1997-06-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>Year ended March 31,		  1997	    1996</p>
<p>NET SALES $			  $17,171,496   $ 3,950,455</p>
<p>OPERATING LOSS:		     (2,783,937)   (3,466,649)</p>
<p> Litigation expense			   --	 (39,000)</p>
<p>NET LOSS				(2,736,660)   (3,282,598) (a)</p>
<p>PREFERRED STOCK DIVIDENDS	 (1,594,406)   (3,268,271) (a)</p>
<p>NET LOSS APPLICABLE TO</p>
<p> COMMON STOCK			$(4,331,066)  $(6,550,869) (a)</p>
<p>LOSS PER COMMON SHARE	    $	(.12)  $	(.25) (a)</p>
<p>WEIGHTED AVERAGE COMMON</p>
<p> SHARES OUTSTANDING		 35,039,360    26,316,832</p>
<p>NOTE: (a)  Amounts have been restated from previous report to reflect a stock dividend on preferred stock which is convertible at a discount from market value at the date of issuance.</p>
<p>Results reflect change in accounting for preferred stock that is covertible into common stock at a discount from market rate at issuance. 1997 earnings per share were cut by $0.04 and fiscal 1996 earnings per share were cut by $0.12 from the accounting change.</p>
</text>
